/E (Key Findings:)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
598 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/E (The model achieved an F1-score of 0.7111 on unseen test data, close to its cross-validation F1-score of 0.7140. However, it missed approximately 34.27% \(100% - Recall\) of actual >$50K earners, highlighting recall as a limitation. ROC-AUC \(ideal = 1\) of 0.9277 indicates strong ability to distinguish the two income classes across classification thresholds.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
