/E (Conclusion & Improvements)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Research Question: Can feature selection maintain or improve income classification performance and does XGBoost outperform Logistic Regression?)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
623 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1249 0 R
/E (Answer: Yes, within the scope of our experiments. ANOVA and MI each reduced the number of encoded inputs by 25% compared with their respective baselines while maintaining similar predictive performance. Therefore, neither approach demonstrated a meaningful improvement in predictive performance. XGBoost also outperformed Logistic Regression across all three feature-selection approaches based on mean validation F1-score.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Evaluation & Conclusion)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
