/P 213 0 R
/Pg 29 0 R
/A [1250 0 R 0]
/K [4]
>>
endobj
626 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Limitations & Improvements:)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
627 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1251 0 R
/E (Limited Tuning & Model Selection: Only a limited hyperparameter grid was tested and differences between XGBoost experiments were extremely small.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1252 0 R
/E (Improvement: Explore wider hyperparameter tuning and repeated or nested cross-validation to assess model stability.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1253 0 R
/E (Class Imbalance & Recall: The model missed 34.27% of actual >$50K earners, highlighting its difficulty identifying the minority class.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
630 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1254 0 R
/E (Improvement: Investigate class weights and alternative classification thresholds using cross-validation.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
631 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1255 0 R
/E (Feature Selection: ANOVA and MI evaluate features individually and may miss interactions between features.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
632 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1256 0 R
/E (Improvement: Explore interaction-aware methods and compare redundant education features.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
633 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1257 0 R
/E (Historical Data & Fairness: The 1994 US Census dataset may not reflect current income patterns, while demographic differences in prediction errors remain.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
634 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1258 0 R
/E (Improvement: Evaluate the model on newer, independent data and conduct further fairness assessments.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
635 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (Final Recommendation:)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
636 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (XGBoost with ANOVA is our preferred model among the tested configurations. However, further validation and fairness evaluation are necessary before considering real-world deployment.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
